 "summary": "This is a mutual NDA between Northwind Labs, Inc. and Kestrel Logistics Corp., effective 2025-01-02, with an 18-month term and confidentiality obligations lasting 5 years after termination. It is governed by Florida law and contains no liability cap, payment terms, or renewal provisions."
